# Exascale — Tilt config for local dev. `tilt up` (run by `make up`) builds + deploys services
# into the k3d cluster and live-reloads on save. Services register here as they're scaffolded
# (each feature/agent adds its block). See docs/plans/LOCAL_DEV.md.

